  "support": {
    "status": "candidate",
    "since": "2026-11-11",
    "evidence": [
      "Live on 2026-11-11 with a real Steam client (build 26334388) through hosted Takaro: the plugin loads under SourceMod 1.13 on server version 11191711, identifies on protocol 1, and getPlayers carries the Steam ids the server status shows; the player joins the existing Takaro player, again after a server restart and a client reconnect",
      "srcds.exe, bin/engine.dll and tf/bin/server.dll are byte-identical to the windows-25995664 pin; only tf/steam.inf (the version string) changed",
      "games/tf2/tests/validate-static.mjs (contract level, every build: action, event, cvar and wire-shape checks over the plugin source)"
    ],
    "notes": "The connector is a SourceMod plugin (takaro_tf2.smx) plus the ProjectSky websocket and json extensions; it holds the Takaro connection itself, no sidecar. It needs MetaMod:Source 1.12 and SourceMod 1.13 on the server (SourceMod 1.12 crashes current TF2 builds); neither is shipped in the zip. The plugin uses SourceMod's game-event and SDK APIs only, no code addresses, so a new TF2 build usually keeps working, but every build needs a live retest before it is declared."
  },
